    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852200/extras/02a5c71a26b26f82c8bf21e7bc30dfac.avif?t=1751840608\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OCRPG is an Arcade Styled Indie RPG game with unique upgrade based gameplay.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852200/extras/9cefec0ad26635f292baa560397a1c54.avif?t=1751840608\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Coma and 0uter, two unlikely friends who are working together to discover the secrets of the Gauntlets. Work with CT-RNF to defeat the 8 Gauntlet Guardians and reclaim the 8 Artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852200/extras/ccef861d326157ab87300783b922e5d3.avif?t=1751840608\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 24+ unique battles with their own mechanics and gimmicks! Have fun discovering each enemies unique fighting styles, and how to work around them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852200/extras/20506e58be3faadbbccec9b491658ba8.avif?t=1751840608\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 70+ Fragments, which modify your characters abilities, stats, and more! Equip up to six at once to make your preferred loadout!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852200/extras/6526cf86c59c90417200d88590aced24.avif?t=1751840608\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 8 different playable characters to help you on your journey! Each with their own skill sets, Fragments, and more! Try out different character combos to discover your favorite play style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852200/extras/9241ac3143ab3b38a1cf02d54e87e11e.avif?t=1751840608\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay the games levels in ENDLESS to try out different character or Fragment combos! Try your best to survive as long as possible with rising enemy difficulty. See which characters can get you the best scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852200/extras/ddb681612ab16fe8405066f68f03e5db.avif?t=1751840608\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know each character with TONS of fun dialogue.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852200/extras/02a5c71a26b26f82c8bf21e7bc30dfac.avif?t=1751840608\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OCRPG is an Arcade Styled Indie RPG game with unique upgrade based gameplay.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852200/extras/9cefec0ad26635f292baa560397a1c54.avif?t=1751840608\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Coma and 0uter, two unlikely friends who are working together to discover the secrets of the Gauntlets. Work with CT-RNF to defeat the 8 Gauntlet Guardians and reclaim the 8 Artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852200/extras/ccef861d326157ab87300783b922e5d3.avif?t=1751840608\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 24+ unique battles with their own mechanics and gimmicks! Have fun discovering each enemies unique fighting styles, and how to work around them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852200/extras/20506e58be3faadbbccec9b491658ba8.avif?t=1751840608\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 70+ Fragments, which modify your characters abilities, stats, and more! Equip up to six at once to make your preferred loadout!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852200/extras/6526cf86c59c90417200d88590aced24.avif?t=1751840608\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 8 different playable characters to help you on your journey! Each with their own skill sets, Fragments, and more! Try out different character combos to discover your favorite play style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852200/extras/9241ac3143ab3b38a1cf02d54e87e11e.avif?t=1751840608\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay the games levels in ENDLESS to try out different character or Fragment combos! Try your best to survive as long as possible with rising enemy difficulty. See which characters can get you the best scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852200/extras/ddb681612ab16fe8405066f68f03e5db.avif?t=1751840608\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know each character with TONS of fun dialogue.</p>",
